<section class="section" id="how">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Monitor · Control · Continue</p>
      <h2>Your agents work.<br />You stay in control.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Herdbell stays out of sight until an agent needs you, then gets you back to your own work quickly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-num">01</div>
        <h3>Never miss an agent that needs you</h3>
        <p>A soft glow near your cursor tells you when an agent is blocked, done, or broken, without pinging banners or pulling you out of focus.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-num">02</div>
        <h3>Control agents without switching windows</h3>
        <p>Approve a command, deny it, or send a quick reply straight from the popup. Your editor and browser stay right where they are.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-num">03</div>
        <h3>Switch agents without losing context</h3>
        <p>Hit a usage limit? Generate a continuation prompt from your session and pick up in another agent right where you left off.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
